 "_readme": [
  "Per-car tuning for the 3D layer. Every field is optional; missing files just mean",
  "that car keeps its drawn 2D look. Drop processed models in this folder as <id>.glb.",
  "Fields: file (defaults to <id>.glb), lengthFt (real car length, sets scale),",
  "yaw (radians to make the nose face away from the camera: 0, 1.5708, 3.1416...),",
  "paintMats [exact material names to recolor], spinWheels (false to disable),",
  "trackFt / rearAxleZFt / frontAxleZFt / cowlZFt / cowlYFt / chuteYFt (gear-kit anchors),",
  "kit { slicks, fronts, blower, zoomies, chutes, wheelieBar } to add built parts,",
  "kitOnly (render only the built running gear - dev/testing), disabled (skip 3D).",
  "sketchfabUid + author + license feed tools/get-models.mjs and the credits list."
 ],
